             The report concludes that human activities are the primary cause of these changes. Without drastic actions, society faces extreme and unprecedented damage.";

            // Function to extract and summarize the main points from the article
            string SummarizeArticle(string title, string content)
            {
                // Split the content into main points
                string[] mainPoints = Regex.Split(content, @"\n(-|[.]|\s+([-]))+");

                // Keep only the first three main points as summary
                string summary = $"{title}: {String.Join(".", mainPoints.Take(3).Select((p, i) => $"{i+1}. {p}"))}\n";
                return summary;
            }

            // Call the function to get the summary
            string summary = SummarizeArticle(articleTitle, articleContent);

            Console.WriteLine(summary);
        }
    }
}
```

This is a basic console application in C# that uses regular expressions to split the article content into main points and then prints the first three points as the summary. This example focuses on verbosity (explaining the process), while keeping the code relatively simple. If needed, more complex algorithms like machine learning models could be integrated for better understanding and extraction of key points.

